    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "cutting through cloth",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "静まり返った部屋に、仕立て屋が厚い布を裁ち鋏で切る裂ぱくの音が響き渡った。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "彼女は古いシーツをウエスにするため、勢いよく布を裂き、鋭い裂ぱくの音を立てた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "剣の修行中、振り下ろした木刀が風を切る音が、まるで裂ぱくの音のように鋭く道場に響いた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "gloss": "shrieking sound",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "突然、森の奥から裂ぱくの悲鳴が聞こえ、探検隊のメンバーは一斉に足を止めた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "夜道で背後から聞こえた裂ぱくの叫び声に、私は心臓が止まるかと思うほど驚いた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "映画のクライマックスで、怪物の放つ裂ぱくの咆哮が映画館のスピーカーから轟いた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "cry of the lesser cuckoo (Cuculus poliocephalus)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "初夏の夜明け前、静けさを破るホトトギスの裂ぱくの鳴き声で目が覚めた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "山奥の温泉宿でくつろいでいると、遠くからホトトギスの裂ぱくの鋭い声が聞こえてきて風情があった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "古典文学に描かれるホトトギスの裂ぱくの声を、一度でいいから実際の山林で聞いてみたいと思っていた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
